euros, was awarded in December 2025.\nWhat it cannot show: The concentration of contracts in December does not indicate improper activity. It may reflect seasonal demand or budgetary planning. Similar patterns can occur due to market conditions or operational needs, not wrongdoing.\nWhat can be checked: Check the contract details for [1] and [2] to see if they align with the body's stated needs. Verify if multiple contracts in December cover the same service or supply to ensure no duplication. Review if the amounts are consistent with market rates for the goods or services provided.","origen_es":"modelo","origen_en":"modelo","modelo":"Qwen3-4B (Q4_K_M, llama.cpp)","regla":"ss","citas":["NYBd6mBab95QFSeKCRun4Q%3D%3D","yTSjAhAo8efyoM4us5k4vw%3D%3D","RvYQKASXGr8S7pcxhTeWOg%3D%3D"],"generado":"2026-11-16"}}